Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:47.46,Title,0,0,0,0,,《死神来了3》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.76,0:01:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信命运吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe in fortunes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶…哈哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man! Heh heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到没有？- 喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see that? - Woo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.33,0:02:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 哈哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶！- 真棒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! Yes! - Nice, nice, nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真要命！- 没白来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aw, sick! - Worth the wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.43,0:03:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 宝贝 你错过机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, babe. You missed out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to get off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,高空死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}HIGH DIE{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是够刺激！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was intense, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,体验一回「粉身碎骨」的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}To feel how that would be to just crash and burn like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.19,0:03:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 也许你感觉不错吧 我们魂都吓掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Maybe for you, but our lives are actually goin' somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 下一个目标 云霄飞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! OK, well, where we gotta go is to the roller coaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的通行证只到9：15\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause our pass is for 9:15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,错过这次 就得再排上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we miss that, we'll stand in line…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多一天半的队 那可得要我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}for, like, a day and a half, and that's gonna kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 准备好了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK! - All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦金利高中 05级 毕业晚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome mc klnley hlgh grad party 05{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全准备消遣这家伙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're totally gonna dig this man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 先去吃点炸薯喝杯可乐不碍事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Come on, it won't kill us to get a deep-fried Snickers and a Coke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐恶魔航班之前？那会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before ridin' Devil's Flight? Yeah, that might kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 未能击垮你的事会使你变得更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! What doesn't kill you makes you stronger, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇！- 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unh! - Ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这个我来拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'll take that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了 还我…相机不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Come on, gimme. It's not even mine, Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.07,0:04:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是借来拍同学录的 凯文…给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the yearbook's. Just…Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢！- 拍到了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - Oh, got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天！你真是个白痴 - 嗨！给我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God, you're such an idiot. - Hey. Hey. Gimme the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.97,0:04:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔！- 干得好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ow! - Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.11,0:04:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…你能不能把刚才史黛西那张删了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, could you, like, please delete that one of Stacy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些照片是拍来制作同学录的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are for the yearbook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天就是最后期限 我得赶着交过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to turn them in tomorrow to make a deadline…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于小林 史黛西的裙下春光能否入选\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, like, I doubt it if a shot of Stacy Kobayashi's camel toe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna make it in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要有了 我买两份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew. l'd buy two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.99,0:04:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,38号 你们点的东西好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number 38, your order's ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文总是玩过界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin can get so out of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是把我逼到崩溃边缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just say he would make me crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…你晓得我是个控制狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! I mean, you know I'm such a control freak…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我却控制不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I couldn't handle that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和他分手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm breaking up with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕业以后几周之内就提出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of weeks. After graduation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意不是一时冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been wanting to for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过别告诉别人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't tell anybody, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:05:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给那边来一张 到时候同学录绝对大卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that shot there? That'll sell some yearbooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love it. - I love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 谁叫我这么爱控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, all right, so I'm a total whore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！加油！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, go, go, go, go, go, go go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 阿什丽 你就要赢了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Ashley, you're winning. You're totally winning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 再加把劲 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I winning? - Yeah, come on, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！加油！\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, come on, come on, come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了？看看旁边的对手 我不想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I winning? Look around, I don't want to look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.37,0:05:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢定了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're totally winning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on, come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别往旁边看 - 天啊！再加把劲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't look! - Oh, my God! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！我赢了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! I'm winning! I'm winning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.15,0:05:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赢了！- 我说嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won! - I knew you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.45,0:05:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 快把奖品给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Gimme my prize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝贺你 - 真是太棒了 阿什丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good job. - That was so awesome, Ashley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.89,0:05:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woo! Ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.83,0:05:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位兄台 玩得尽兴吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How ya doin', my brother? You havin' a good time, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢这个？- 哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You like that? - Ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了！来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! You like it. Give it up. Give it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没毕业吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a senior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are you gonna do about it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.15,0:06:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「甜心」小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss "Cutest Couple, " Rah Rah? Ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给妈讲了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom know you're here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.69,0:06:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是去告状 就是彻底的小贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a complete bitch if you tell her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这可以作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proof where you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种就拍这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a shot of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.57,0:06:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我就说嘛 是3\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! That's what I'm talking about. That's three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,3 是3号\N{\fnArial\fs30}? That is three, number three?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真有种\N{\fnArial\fs30}? Oh, I'm the man, I'm the man? Man, I am hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我你们的手 - 这儿 这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Man, gimme some right here, man. - Right here! Right here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？滚远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you doin'? Get the fuck back. Hoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是了不起 再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, I am good. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 让我告诉你什么是 见你的鬼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, I'll tell ya… Goddamn. Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻点 先生 请站上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind sir, step right up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.29,0:06:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧 想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ya go. Whaddaya want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝 第3层 你们都是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go, baby. 3 for 3. It's all mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要大奖 看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big prize. Watch out. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是要这个 蓝色的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna get that one. You want that blue one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one we gonna get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…跑不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can run, but you cannot hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 哇 就是这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - Whoo! Here we are, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶！- 喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是它 - 酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There it is. - Awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.03,0:07:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 拍张这个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, get a pic of this. Ahhh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一条不归路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the beginning of the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 排好队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, get in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再玩一次吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go on again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有种预感 就像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was having that feeling like deja vu, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,能看到还没有发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for something that hasn't happened yet.{\r}
