Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我来个「波涛汹涌」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Show me your titties!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.63,0:16:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去你妈的 弗兰基！- 噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck off, Frankie! - Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！我们会掉下去的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! We're gonna fall off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哟荷 - 凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yow! - Kevin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳 抓牢了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erin, hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.31,0:18:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓紧它！- 别放手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on! - Don't let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓不住了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳了 温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Wen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳了 和我一起摇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on! Help me rock it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快动了 慢慢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost got it! Gently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你看不懂…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo. What, you can't read?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 那我装包里可以么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well. I'll just… I'll put it in my pocket, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.04,0:19:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 温 让我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh. All right. Let's do this, Wen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.41,0:19:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！冲吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Let's do it, baby! Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.91,0:19:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get off of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别按按钮！别！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't push the button! Don't! Don't push the button!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我走！快放我走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh! Let me off! Let me off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,温…没事的 一下就过去了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wen, Wen! It's all right. Jesus, it's gonna be over…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,会翻车的 要翻车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! It's gonna crash! It's gonna crash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.36,0:19:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,液压管会破裂的…！轨道也…也要垮！求求你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hydraulics will rupture! The tracks'll collapse! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.99,0:19:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 让我下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - Let me off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这妞发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chick's on somethin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…没事的 你不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right! You'll be OK!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 让他们下去 打开后面那几排\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, let 'em out. Just the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,温！温迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wen. Hey! Wendy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. Now, what's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了一切 在我脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it. I saw it in my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,轨道垮了 云霄飞车摔成碎片…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tracks collapsed. The roller coaster crashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.61,0:19:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 她刚才就是有点紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she was just a little upset before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.41,0:19:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你能不能管好这妞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, please, can you please control that bitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:20:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,见她的鬼！什么「液压管…飞车摔得粉碎…」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn."It's gonna crash! The hydraulics, the coaster!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.85,0:20:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这贱人就是想吸引大家眼球！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, she's just trying to get some fuckin' attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 刘易斯？你他妈就狗屎一砣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're a real piece of shit, Lewis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 操你妈的！- 操我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck you. - Fuck moi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 操你妈的！- 别碰我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, man, fuck you! - Don't touch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.83,0:20:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,打啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.16,0:20:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！让我下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey. Let me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不许下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody else gets off this ride!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 让我下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, let me off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.87,0:20:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是长不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}So high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家不要慌！- 离他远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calm down! - Get off of him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放手！- 伊安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax! - lan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.51,0:20:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐们去哪里？这正有好戏看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you ladies going? There's a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他弄出去！大家不要惊慌！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of here! Hey! Calm down! Relax!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.01,0:20:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 让我下去 我得看看她有没有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, let me off. I gotta make sure she's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.35,0:20:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了！不要闹了！- 嘿！我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax! Calm down! - Hey! Ho! Let's go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把你的手拿开！- 出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get your big ass off me, man! - Hey, ho, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我下去！- 嘿哟！快点走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me out! - Hey, ho, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿哟！快点走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}? Hey, ho, let's go, hey, ho, let's go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿哟！快点走！- 让我下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here we go! - Let me off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.69,0:20:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿哟！快点走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}? Hey, ho{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.73,0:20:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 那是我女朋友！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, that's my girlfriend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来！快停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! No! Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:20:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！求求你！轨道会垮的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! Please! Please, the tracks are broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.64,0:21:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！求求你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.21,0:21:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 好么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just relax, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求求你！- 她没事 别动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please! - Ease up, man. She's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.55,0:21:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她自己静一静\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK? Just let her settle down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家安静去吧 听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can settle down at home! Now listen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家里电话多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is your home phone number?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会给你妈妈打电话 一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, we're gonna call your mother. Everything will be taken care of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.86,0:21:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！杰森！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Jason!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:22:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 温迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Wendy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.29,0:23:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 温迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wendy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.80,0:23:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,温…等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, Wen. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.43,0:23:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话跟你讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need…I need to talk to you about something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.17,0:23:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来领毕业证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just here to pick up my diploma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不参加毕业典礼了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to graduation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.31,0:23:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 从那该死的地方出来的 不是只有你一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're not the only one in a fucked up place, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.41,0:23:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 也许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I mean, I just thought maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.11,0:23:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,同有异样感觉的人在一起 也许会好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd be good for you to be somewhere where other people feel the same way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.18,0:23:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在毕业典礼上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}At graduation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.22,0:23:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 我参加的葬礼够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Thanks. I've had enough funerals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.98,0:23:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是为了杰和卡丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then do it for J and Carrie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.42,0:23:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他们做什么？人死了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what? If you die, then there's nothing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.29,0:23:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是死了 什么都不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you're just dead, and they don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要是真到了天堂 同圣人们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they are up in Heaven with Lincoln and Gandhi…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.96,0:23:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为谁还会在乎一个破毕业典礼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you think they really care about our high school graduation? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.46,0:23:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我这个活人都不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am alive, and I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我开车离开这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I pull out of that parking lot…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.30,0:23:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此就和麦金利学校没有任何关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so out of McKinley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.63,0:23:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了杰 还有什么值得留恋的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without J, what's here for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here. OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.07,0:23:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向杰保证会照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a promise to J that I would take care of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.54,0:23:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐云霄飞车 3分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ride. For 3 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.41,0:23:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没叫你照顾我一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't making the promise for a lifetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.48,0:23:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是看在杰和你是哥们儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it wasn't for you and J being friends…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.22,0:23:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我和卡丽又是好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and me and Carrie being friends…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.95,0:23:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩都不会再一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}we wouldn't have even hung out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.79,0:24:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不欣赏对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even like each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.17,0:24:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊安·麦金利\N{\fnArial\fs30}"lan McKinley."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.60,0:24:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我这破姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}How pathetic is it that my last name…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.07,0:24:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一看就是个高中生\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the same as my high school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱丽 快看我找谁签名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie, look who I got to sign my yearbook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.68,0:24:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 真棒！- 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way. Nice. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.32,0:24:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是要邀请她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should invite her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.32,0:24:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.93,0:24:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,温 这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wen? Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.83,0:24:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备去今晚的毕业典礼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're ready for graduation tonight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.43,0:24:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会儿我们要去日光浴沙龙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're going to the tanning salon after this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.87,0:24:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是想一起去 我们完全没意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are so totally cool if you wanna come with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.34,0:24:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.51,0:24:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就聊聊天什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just like, talk if you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.78,0:24:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我手机号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.18,0:24:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已有你手机号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already have your number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.65,0:25:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真是善良啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was so nice of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.59,0:25:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我很感激大家的好心\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I appreciate everyone trying to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.96,0:25:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我真的感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK? I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.23,0:25:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这个 之前也有类似的事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's happened before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.00,0:25:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了找到合理的解释我上网查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK? I went online looking for an explanation about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.07,0:25:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪 听我一句好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy, just…just listen to me, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.37,0:25:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 听着 我上网查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, I went online looking for an explanation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.44,0:25:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会发生这一切 我查到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what happened, and I found out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.91,0:25:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约一个高中法语班\N{\fnArial\fs30}about this high school French class from New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.48,0:25:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,6年前 他们去巴黎旅游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six years ago they went on a trip to Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.52,0:25:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在登机的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they were boarding…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.85,0:25:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个孩子产生了飞机爆炸的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}a kid had a vision that the plane was gonna explode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.52,0:25:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你当时那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.42,0:25:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他害怕极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He freaked out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.02,0:25:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有7个人同时下了飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and seven people got off the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.93,0:25:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.37,0:25:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,起飞后不久 180航班就坠毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on takeoff, Flight 180 blew up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.10,0:25:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下去的几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}And over the next several months…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.47,0:26:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有从飞机上下来的人 都相继死于离奇的事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone who got off that plane started dying in weird accidents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.68,0:26:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡的顺序 就是他们在飞机上座位的顺序\N{\fnArial\fs30}They died in the order they would've if they had stayed on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.18,0:26:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非有人干预 然后死神就跳过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless someone intervened, then it skipped them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.62,0:26:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.22,0:26:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪 温迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-Wendy! Wendy! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.08,0:26:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我们来这儿都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, every time we come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.98,0:26:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想要不要做20分钟的米勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking of going for 20 minutes in the Muller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.25,0:26:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次参加葬礼前做了 效果很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did that for all the funerals and it turned out amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.02,0:26:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但才过了没几个礼拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but that was just a couple of weeks ago, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.49,0:26:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们的皮肤还算古铜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're still pretty bronzed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.09,0:26:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我们也许做个综合调理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just thinking we could go for, like, a tune-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.99,0:26:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望能以最漂亮的方式出场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna make sure that we look our best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.43,0:26:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.73,0:26:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 那天晚上死掉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for all those kids that died that night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.80,0:26:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们永远不能参加毕业典礼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who will never get a graduation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.54,0:27:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're totally right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.07,0:27:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很难过 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.73,0:27:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的 我的幸运手链\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my…my good guy luck bracelet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.33,0:27:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖母在遗嘱里写了留给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Grandma left me in her will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.94,0:27:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.84,0:27:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.95,0:27:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能给我帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.38,0:27:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于杰森 我感到很自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have such… such guilt over Jason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.55,0:27:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该让车开动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never have let that ride go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.62,0:27:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 我平时是那么有控制欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. I'm usually such a control freak…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.16,0:28:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却没有尽力去阻止这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't do enough to stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.66,0:28:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何我都该阻止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've done everything I could to stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.17,0:28:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意付出一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would give anything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.00,0:28:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能给我一次机会重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have a second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.94,0:28:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不可能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.25,0:28:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望有一天 我对你也产生这样的愧疚感 茱丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to some day feel that way about you, Julie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.05,0:28:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我和妈妈爸爸谈不到一块儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can't talk to Mom and Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.39,0:28:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all I have left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.39,0:28:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我找到地方搬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think when I find a place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.83,0:28:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能来和我一起住一阵子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you could come stay with me for a while?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.23,0:28:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.40,0:28:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.11,0:28:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,先保管它\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep this now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.64,0:28:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看你的时候要回\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll get it when I come see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.81,0:28:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对了 那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. And…hey, how 'bout on your end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.18,0:28:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能借照相机用吗 为了今晚的毕业典礼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I use the school camera for graduation tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.39,0:29:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 不过礼拜一一定要带来学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. As long as you bring it back to school on Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.26,0:29:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.96,0:29:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 电量有点低了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, the battery is pretty low…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.43,0:29:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你先去准备 我给它充会儿电\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why don't you go get ready, and I'll recharge it a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.76,0:29:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.61,0:29:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶时间 犹利\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln a hurry, Yuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.75,0:29:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉 手机在室内根本没信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sorry. Cell phone signal is shit in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.78,0:29:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是阳光浴床干扰了信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think tanning beds mess with signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.79,0:29:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只好到外面去听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must go outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.29,0:29:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不用电话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just use that phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.09,0:29:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想啊 但她说起来就没完 老板非宰了我不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would, but she talks forever, then my boss gives me shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.83,0:29:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 又是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. That's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.23,0:29:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出去听吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Just go outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.37,0:29:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can deal with this ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.73,0:29:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.17,0:29:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这次别在房间里喝饮料了 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. No drinks in the room this time, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.31,0:29:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.42,0:30:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.59,0:30:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想有人进来看见我的裸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody is walking in here and seein' me naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.59,0:31:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.83,0:32:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了不要带饮料进来 如果溅出来了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, he said no drinks. If you spill that shit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.27,0:32:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们得像上次一样清扫一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna have to clean it up like last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.27,0:32:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吧 不会溅出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy, beyotch? Nothing to spill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.78,0:32:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,犹利干嘛把温度调那么低？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does Yuri keep it so cold in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.41,0:32:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这些机器必须保持低温也说不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's supposed to be colder for the machines or whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.95,0:32:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,开高几度不会怎么样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a few degrees won't hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.05,0:32:27.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（此设备使用强度不可超过250伏特交流电）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.34,0:32:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 我忘带iPod了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! I forgot my iPod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.38,0:32:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucks, bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.41,0:32:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这有CD的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got CDs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.99,0:32:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,席琳的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ew. Celine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.06,0:32:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是布兰妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Britney?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.49,0:32:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 到这儿来的人中 我们是不是唯一跟得上潮流的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, are we like the only cool people that come here or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.73,0:33:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.66,0:33:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便听吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.58,0:33:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛还穿内裤？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you wearing underwear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.78,0:33:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦梅说 他看到晒痕就兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steinmetz says he gets off on tan lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.05,0:33:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.46,0:34:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.03,0:34:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱之车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.37,0:34:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say what{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.74,0:34:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.91,0:34:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.14,0:34:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.18,0:34:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱之车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.01,0:34:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.51,0:34:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车 爱之车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster of love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.35,0:34:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.79,0:34:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车 爱之车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster of love…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.48,0:35:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.45,0:35:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼…哼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}? Huh, huh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.29,0:35:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,要与你同行 女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ride, girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.04,0:35:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.77,0:35:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车 爱之车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster of love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.84,0:35:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最爱云霄飞车 女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}? Love roller coaster, girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.11,0:35:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.91,0:35:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界太乱 我只爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovin' you in a freaky world, child{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.82,0:35:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车 爱之车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster of love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.09,0:35:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,相机充好电了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camera charged?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.50,0:35:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉 完全没电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, um, sorry, the battery's totally dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.43,0:35:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没法开机 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camera's not working. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.54,0:35:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱丽 我需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Julie, I need a minute, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.77,0:36:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人静一静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like private.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.38,0:36:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车 感觉真棒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That feels nice, roller coaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.32,0:36:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.62,0:36:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车 爱之车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster of love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.12,0:36:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.96,0:36:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,云霄飞车 爱之车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roller coaster of love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.20,0:36:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有点热过头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's way too warm in here now, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.91,0:36:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 我把温度调太高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucked up. I set it too hot in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.91,0:36:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.10,0:36:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.27,0:37:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 阿什丽 是我温迪 - 美体中！请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Ashley, it's Wendy… - Psych! Leave a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.70,0:37:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 阿什丽 是我温迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Ashley, this is Wendy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.04,0:37:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们弄完后给我回个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme a call whenever you guys are done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.11,0:37:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有再次感谢你们邀请我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thanks again for the invite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.01,0:37:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人帮忙吗？- 啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone help! - Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.05,0:37:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我打晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I was too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.91,0:37:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.76,0:37:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.14,0:38:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我们觉得生命难以掌握\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may feel that our lives are not our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.55,0:38:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎死神掌管着我们生命的轨迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Death controls, frames our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.58,0:38:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,出生即是死亡的序曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our birth's nothing but death begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.99,0:38:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 不管是年轻生命消逝的悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet, whether it is with this tragic loss of young lives…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.62,0:38:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,使我们悲伤不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we have suffered much of late…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.06,0:38:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是在夜晚安详逝去的老者\N{\fnArial\fs30}or with the soft passing of the elderly in the night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.00,0:38:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在死神的眼里都是平等的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are all equal in Death's eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.67,0:38:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「在死神眼里是平等的」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Equal in Death's eyes?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.37,0:38:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人吗？你怎么能这么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us? How can you say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.41,0:38:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 麦金利！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, McKinley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.68,0:38:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 想想吧 查理·曼森活到了70岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, think it through. Charlie Manson made it to 70.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.38,0:38:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿萨马呢？还活着 - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Osama? Still kickin'. - Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.45,0:38:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉皮条的 副总统 到处活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pimps, vice-presidents walking around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.18,0:38:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们所犯了的种种罪恶… - 我们走吧 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All the atrocities they've committed… - Let's just go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.92,0:39:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,却还好好活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're alive and well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.22,0:39:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个女孩 她们从没害过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These two girls, who'd never done shit to anybody…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.33,0:39:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘘 - 连18岁都活不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shh! - They don't get to make it to 18?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.56,0:39:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的平等在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the fucking equality in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.53,0:39:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说啊？- 走吧 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.53,0:39:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can…Yeah. Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.23,0:39:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. All right. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.90,0:39:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.70,0:39:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.94,0:39:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要对逝者做最后追忆的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those of you who would like to pay a final remembrance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.28,0:39:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请上前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}please step forward at this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.09,0:39:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I so feel this is so my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.19,0:39:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能是你的错？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could it possibly be your fault?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.69,0:39:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只把女人当作玩乐的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seein' women as nothin' but fun bags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.83,0:39:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能看到她们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…if l'd've seen their…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.87,0:39:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,人性的一面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever…humanity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.70,0:39:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们也不会为了要外表漂亮 而感到那么大压力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they wouldn't have felt the pressure to look so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.81,0:39:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了吸引弗兰基 去减肥 去除臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}lmpress Franklin Cheeks. Go on diets. Deodorize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.24,0:39:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去健身 去晒日光浴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stretch. Tan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.65,0:40:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别难过 弗兰基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be down, Frankie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.28,0:40:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该为你能把所有事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be proud of your ability to make everything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.08,0:40:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,都归到你头上的能力 感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}that happens somehow a story about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.16,0:40:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.70,0:40:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情确实糟透了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, man. These things really suck, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.34,0:40:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking boring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.61,0:40:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果下次你来参加我的葬礼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, if you ever have to come to my funeral…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.48,0:40:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我带个掌上游戏机什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}man, bring me a PSP or somethin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.25,0:40:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我能有点事做\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Least I have somethin' to do then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.26,0:40:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.49,0:40:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在杰的墓旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.48,0:41:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这哭鼻子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing up here in the nosebleeds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.86,0:41:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把你排在第二排\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I could've gotten you second row.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.82,0:41:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想在那儿加剧别人的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to upset anyone by being there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.09,0:41:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想如果我呆在这儿 也许能感到杰的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wondered if maybe here I could feel J's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.77,0:41:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂或者看到他现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}spirit or presence or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.27,0:41:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.30,0:41:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我在这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now that I'm here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.14,0:41:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,却感到了死后根本没有灵魂 这种感觉从未有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there's any place that makes me feel like there's no life after death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.41,0:41:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是公墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a cemetery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.28,0:41:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也没有感觉到凯丽的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I haven't felt Carrie's spirit either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.29,0:41:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.06,0:41:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很努力的试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real hard. Heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.73,0:41:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也许他的灵魂在那晚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe he's been with me since…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.80,0:42:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上车之前 就已经和我在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that night… before I got on the ride…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.97,0:42:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森说的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.91,0:42:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 就是那句话使我同意上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, and it was just to get me on the ride…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.54,0:42:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.38,0:42:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你害怕的是不能控制」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your fear is from a sense of having no control."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.98,0:42:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的那一刻我就感觉到害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've felt that fear since the moment he said it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.72,0:42:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许那也是导致幻觉的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even thought it maybe somehow caused the hallucination…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.69,0:42:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这种害怕不仅仅是感到恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this fear is more than just being scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.33,0:42:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是感到某种东西的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.93,0:42:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像有东西一直跟随着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a living thing always with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.47,0:42:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那是杰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's J?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.03,0:42:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我知道不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.60,0:42:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和杰在我身边完全不同的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This presence is the opposite of how J made me feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.51,0:42:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,又冷 又可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cold and terrifying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.55,0:43:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是林肯照的最后一张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last photograph Lincoln posed for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.15,0:43:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,底片被划破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The photographic plate was broken…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.69,0:43:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成了一条无法抹去的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}causing a line that can't be removed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.09,0:43:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是他中弹的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly where he was shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.09,0:43:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个 看到阴影了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. See the shadow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.56,0:43:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些照片和我们有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what do these pictures have to do with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.23,0:43:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张照片照于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. This occurred one year to the day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.63,0:43:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,180航班出事的一年前 看到路上的标记吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Flight 180 disaster. Look at the road sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.74,0:43:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你和我说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I guess you came to me with this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.81,0:43:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是因为我该为告诉你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm responsible for putting this in your head…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.14,0:43:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,180航班的事负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the Flight 180 thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.41,0:43:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它确实发生了 说不定也发生在我们周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it did happen, and it may be occurring here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.48,0:43:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能相信所有古怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't believe every weird thing out there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.28,0:43:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为你绝望的想找一个答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're desperate for an answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.45,0:43:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是我拍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.38,0:43:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.26,0:44:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}These?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.80,0:44:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.94,0:44:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.04,0:44:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.08,0:44:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, hey. You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.22,0:44:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些虚脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm feeling a little woozy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.52,0:44:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多久没吃东西了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you ate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.69,0:44:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.46,0:44:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 来 我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. I'll drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.53,0:44:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些曾经在180航班上 之后死于事故的孩子们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, those kids on Flight 180 died in accidents…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.27,0:44:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是按照在飞机上的座位顺序 相继出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the order they would've died if they'd have stayed on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.64,0:44:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 要真是这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK? So if this is that, then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.48,0:44:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那阿什丽姐妹后面就是弗兰基\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Frankie was behind Ashlyn and Ashley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.88,0:45:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我看到阿什丽姐妹的照片时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I saw Ashley and Ashlyn's picture…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.21,0:45:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本能的感到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt this instinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.28,0:45:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎照片中有某种暗示 我甚至\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like there was a hint in the picture. I even…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.05,0:45:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至给她们打了电话 看能不能阻止悲剧发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even called to see if I could keep them from going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.55,0:45:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰基的照片是什么样的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's Frankie's picture look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.82,0:45:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.89,0:45:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拍到了？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.23,0:45:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心！- 噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait! Watch out! - Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.76,0:45:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.86,0:45:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.37,0:45:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 就在那儿吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's just eat over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.24,0:45:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直开 开到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}And go through the drive through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.51,0:45:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想任何人听到我们的谈话内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want anyone hearing what we're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.74,0:45:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴看到这件事没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's nice to see that things haven't made you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.47,0:45:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,减少你的控制癖\N{\fnArial\fs30}any less of a control freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.32,0:45:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到了吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it? - Yeah, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.99,0:45:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是弗兰基的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's Frank's picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.05,0:45:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.62,0:45:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 他正从梯子上滑下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is obvious. He's falling off a ladder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.02,0:45:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个绳梯 也许他会吊死\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rope ladder, though. Maybe he might hang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.13,0:45:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 也许没那么夸张 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, or maybe it's not that literal. All right, what's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.86,0:45:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会和这些奖品有关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could there be anything in these prizes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.13,0:45:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道他会被一个 超大的海绵宝宝撞死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what, like he's gonna get crushed by a giant Spongebob?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.90,0:45:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝住在水底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Spongebob lives underwater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.64,0:46:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来这个你还知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so sad that you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.21,0:46:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 他赢了一条傻里傻气的 胶皮女人项链…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. He won that tacky mud-flap girl chain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.28,0:46:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在玩这游戏的时候 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}on this game, though, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.88,0:46:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种胶皮不是通常都用在 18轮巨型卡车上的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}aren't those usually on those big 18 wheelers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.88,0:46:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.18,0:46:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 在照片上找不出什么卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I don't see it in this picture anywhere though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.12,0:46:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.46,0:46:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.53,0:46:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问您需要点餐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, can I take your order?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.73,0:46:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你想吃什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.64,0:46:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.21,0:46:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的无线电是短路了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me there's a short in your wiring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.29,0:46:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 那辆车靠太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Whoa. That guy's way too close to my truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.26,0:46:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你他妈太近了 往前拉点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're too fucking close, man! Pull up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.39,0:46:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.16,0:46:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.87,0:47:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.40,0:47:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,走在你身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking behind you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.40,0:47:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 见鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.10,0:47:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他妈的 - 转过身\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck? - Turn around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.27,0:47:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 上帝！- 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - Look at me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.41,0:47:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下车！下车 - 什么？怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out! Get out! - What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.51,0:47:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们后面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.21,0:47:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡车没人在驾驶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one in that truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.35,0:47:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching your footsteps{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.61,0:47:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！往前开！往前开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Hey! Pull up, man! Come on! Pull up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.75,0:47:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着我 - 哦 该死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at me - Unh! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.42,0:47:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人 - 倒车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There is someone - Back up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.42,0:47:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.49,0:47:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁真心爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who really loves you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.99,0:47:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你看我的真心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.23,0:47:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your eyes! Watch your eyes! Come here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.43,0:47:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}? ln my hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.67,0:47:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过身\N{\fnArial\fs30}? Turn around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.44,0:47:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着我 - 快 我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at me - Come on. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.81,0:47:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.83,0:48:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清理完了 你们要搭车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all done here. You need a ride?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.23,0:48:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以走回到我家…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we can walk to my house…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.73,0:48:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我开车送你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'll give you a ride to yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.47,0:48:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢 一切都会过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks. We'll be OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.74,0:48:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.25,0:48:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们会逃过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.71,0:48:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.28,0:49:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰基那样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}how Frank…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.42,0:49:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 这不仅仅是恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, it…it's not only horrible…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.25,0:49:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感到吗… 能感到这有多么邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}but can you feel… can you feel how vicious it was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.52,0:49:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.93,0:49:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK? Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.16,0:49:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.80,0:49:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先退一步想\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just take a step back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.03,0:49:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？在云霄车上他是坐在阿什丽姐妹后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? He was behind Ashley and Ashlyn on the ride…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.34,0:49:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有梯子 也没有绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there was no ladder here. You know, there was no rope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.47,0:49:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片上没有预示这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing in that picture pointed to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.04,0:49:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were wrong about the photos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.84,0:49:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该来这儿 还不如什么也不知道的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've left town. It's better not knowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.75,0:49:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 被蒙在鼓里永远没有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's never better staying ignorant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.78,0:49:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,被蒙在鼓里等于交出了控制权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willful ignorance is surrendering control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.85,0:49:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 这句话是布鲁克先生的 英语课上学来的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did you read that somewhere in Mrs. Brooks' English class?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.36,0:49:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 知道吗 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. l…you know, I'm not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.59,0:49:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你想象的那样愚蠢透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the total idiot you think I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.16,0:49:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 弗兰基后面是刘易斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, that's Lewis after Frank…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.53,0:49:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是依安和埃琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}then lan and Erin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.63,0:49:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个孩子在他们后面 但我看不清楚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a couple of kids behind them, but I can't make them out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.80,0:49:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙的手挡住了 你看得清吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}because this guy's arm's in the way. Can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.91,0:49:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.94,0:49:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.84,0:50:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以问问刘易斯 依安和埃琳 看他们是不是记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll ask Lewis, lan, and Erin if they remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.31,0:50:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.91,0:50:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有没有其他拍到云霄飞车的照片？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any more pictures from the roller coaster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.73,0:50:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.50,0:50:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些事迟早会发生在我们身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that kind of thing is gonna happen to us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.10,0:50:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生在剩下还活着的人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the rest of our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.33,0:50:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.40,0:50:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我本想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was gonna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.74,0:50:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,本想向她求婚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna ask her to marry me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.48,0:50:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一毕业就求婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right after graduation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.90,0:50:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.90,0:50:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在史黛西后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, behind Stacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.34,0:51:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是弗兰基\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.67,0:51:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片告诉了我们他的死亡方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}This picture shows how he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.31,0:51:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看刘易斯那张\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go back to Lewis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.68,0:51:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿着锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, he's got that hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.15,0:51:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个重力砣正落下来 好像要砸在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the weight looks like it's coming down…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.06,0:51:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.89,0:51:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.92,0:51:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在刘易斯正在州队的训练营里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now Lewis is down at State for football training camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.06,0:51:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,州队的名字就叫苏丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}State's team is called the Sultans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.50,0:51:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个 这就是线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's the clue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.17,0:51:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得告诉他 给他看照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to tell him. Show him these pictures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.41,0:51:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you want to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.01,0:51:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也有照片吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, there's pictures of us in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.41,0:51:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.14,0:51:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.45,0:51:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.48,0:51:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不想看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't want to see mine. No. Huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.28,0:51:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说不想被蒙在鼓里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about willful ignorance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.62,0:51:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我在放屁 行了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm full of shit, all right?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.32,0:51:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我从没想过 我会看到自己是怎么死的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I never thought I could see my own death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.06,0:51:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我还没死前 温迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it happened, Wendy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.49,0:51:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我们可以去告诉刘易斯 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you know what? We can tell Lewis, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.69,0:52:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 如果真有什么能打败死神…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, if there's any way to beat this thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.70,0:52:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会尽全力找出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta stay focused…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.33,0:52:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我看了自己的照片 我只会被吓迷糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if I look at that picture, all I'm gonna do is obsess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.93,0:52:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我不想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know what? No, I don't want to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.61,0:52:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 除非到了不得不看的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, unless we have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.78,0:52:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说当轮到我们的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean until we have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.48,0:52:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.15,0:52:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很糟糕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls it bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.15,0:52:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说是不是很痛苦或者很难堪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, is it, like, painful or embarrassing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.69,0:52:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 没有屁股朝天之类的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's nothing, like, up my ass or anything, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.99,0:52:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.50,0:52:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有病 你们都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You on crack. Both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.17,0:52:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,先听我们说 好吗？先是阿什丽姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen, OK? Ashley and Ashlyn were first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.54,0:52:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是弗兰基 接着是你 这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Frankie Cheeks and then you. This is the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.21,0:52:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 少来了 凯文 - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aw, come on, Kevin. - Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.77,0:52:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦金利和埃琳是下一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}McKinley and Erin were next, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.31,0:52:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两个人在我们前面 你记得是谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there were two people in front of us. Do you remember who they were?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.48,0:52:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 不知道 我也不在乎 你也没必要管这些 老兄…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck no, and I don't care. And you shouldn't care either, man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.78,0:52:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你刚才说的那些 在我听来是胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause what you're tellin' me right now is straight bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.12,0:52:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 刘易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen, Lewis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.22,0:52:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 听过那些故事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, it's like those stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.62,0:52:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男人被车撞死 而这车正是10年前被他卖掉的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this guy was killed by a car he sold 10 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.49,0:53:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,两姐妹 她们同时被撞死 而她们正分别在开车去碰面的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two sisters, right, were killed when they were driving to visit each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.83,0:53:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 就像这类型的屁事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, shit like that, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.99,0:53:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 黑熊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the Bruins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.50,0:53:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 黑熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah! Fuck the Bruins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.77,0:53:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑熊的白痴们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruin faggots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.57,0:53:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 黑熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Fuck the Bruins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.17,0:53:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你以为是在看传说故事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you're reading into this shit like them damn urban legends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.54,0:53:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,3个人死了 刘易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three people have died, Lewis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.54,0:53:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得这件事简单到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if you think this can be written off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.91,0:53:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以用巧合来解释…\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a simple coincidence and it ends there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.91,0:53:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们却拒绝承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're in serious denial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.78,0:53:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们两个呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh! What about you two, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.32,0:53:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.62,0:53:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩的朋友都那么倒霉的死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both lost people real close to you in a fucked-up way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.79,0:53:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了减少罪恶感或者别的什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in order to feel less guilty or whatever…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.76,0:53:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说看到什么记号死亡方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing signs and patterns, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.53,0:53:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想怪你们 但这是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you. But it's wrong, dawg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.33,0:53:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh! It's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.30,0:53:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's denial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.94,0:53:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.34,0:53:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那云霄飞车事件怎么解释？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, what about what happened at the roller coaster? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.64,0:53:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪都看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.68,0:53:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 她不是有预感吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, she got a hunch. Fuckin' intense, but she got a hunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.58,0:53:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干这行也是因为我有预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm here because I get good hunches before every down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.05,0:54:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你知道他们逃不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you know they're either gonna run or pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.08,0:54:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而她的预感是不受她控制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hers came to her from nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.72,0:54:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你因为她而幸存着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here and alive because of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.49,0:54:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我活着是因为我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm alive because of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.02,0:54:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 听着 你还没明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen. You don't get it, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.59,0:54:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你有意义吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that make sense to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.99,0:54:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点意义都没有 凯文 这都是胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to get, Kevin! It's bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.83,0:54:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 听我说好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just hear me out, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.27,0:54:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到幻觉 我能看到我一生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about a vision. Man, I seen my whole life played out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.34,0:54:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神取不了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it sure as hell ain't gonna end now. Unh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.78,0:54:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的活法就像我预料到的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going just as I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.04,0:54:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,35场高校比赛 没有受任何伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}35 high school games without an injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.31,0:54:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美国队全是美国人 - 二队\N{\fnArial\fs30}- USA Today All-American. - Second team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.68,0:54:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为苏丹打球 - 黑熊会赢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Free ride to play for the Sultans! - The Bruins passed on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.68,0:54:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, fuck the Bruins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.25,0:54:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扁死他们 - 他妈的说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck 'em! - You goddamn right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.79,0:54:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑熊算什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is a Bruin anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.89,0:54:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four years from now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.53,0:54:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,刘易斯·罗门路一定会进到 奥克兰的第二轮比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis Romero goin' in the second round to Oakland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.80,0:54:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要玩死对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna romp and stomp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.97,0:54:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,15个赛季 他要带上拳王的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}15 seasons, with four Super Bowl rings on his fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.01,0:54:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,刘易斯不怕死 去你的死神吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis ain't afraid of no death. Fuck Death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.17,0:55:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神是他妈丹佛的拳迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is a fuckin' Denver fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.61,0:55:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着蓝色和桔色的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death wear blue and orange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.35,0:55:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的男人会穿黑色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real men wear black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.18,0:55:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,刘易斯不怕死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis ain't afraid of no Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.38,0:55:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要死神怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is afraid of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.72,0:55:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神怕我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death fears me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.22,0:55:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.49,0:55:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会赢 我会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause, baby, I just win. I just win, Kevin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.62,0:55:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道 我会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I know how to do! I just win! Unh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.56,0:55:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck Death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.90,0:55:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去他妈的黑熊 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck the Bruins! - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.80,0:55:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 刘易斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look out! - Lewis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.37,0:55:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that was close, Lewis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.87,0:55:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.91,0:55:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来告诉你 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! What I tell you, Kevin, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.41,0:55:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 死神 我会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck Death! I just win!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.38,0:55:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是要赢 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I know how to do, Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.81,0:55:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I just win!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.18,0:55:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦！- 上帝啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooooh! - God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.23,0:55:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我做错什么吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I do something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.87,0:55:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,给大家带来这样的灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring this on everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.60,0:56:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 温迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, Wendy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.74,0:56:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是为什么是我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.77,0:56:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么多人 想要拥有预测未来的能力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those people out there wanting to have a premonition…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.07,0:56:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者想看到鬼魂什么的 可是我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}or see a ghost or whatever, and I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.01,0:56:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想让这一切结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want it to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.82,0:56:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.69,0:56:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么 温迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why, Wendy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.42,0:56:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没有做错什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you didn't do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.13,0:56:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？这只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? This is just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.69,0:56:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不上来 我是说 我想知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I mean, I wish I knew why, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.63,0:56:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望即使能猜一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could…I could come up with a guess even…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.40,0:56:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让你觉得好受些 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make you feel OK, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.07,0:56:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.78,0:56:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.18,0:56:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.22,0:56:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开车好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you drive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.29,0:56:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.36,0:56:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便问一句 我的那张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, by the way, that…that picture of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.00,0:57:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头 没有穿过挡风玻璃或者怎么样吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, uh, my head's not, like, through the windshield or anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.33,0:57:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者被方向盘撞碎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, crushed by a steering wheel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.74,0:57:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者被排档杆刺穿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}lmpaled by a gear shift?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.91,0:57:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.82,0:57:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫泽普 我是皮普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip, it's Pip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.56,0:57:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些夹板割的怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you cut those plywood orders yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.03,0:57:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没开工 皮普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, that's a big no, Pip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.56,0:57:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,监督人要我先把那些鸽子弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osama bin Supervisor wants me to get rid of these pigeons first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.96,0:57:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们总是弄响警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}They keep settin' off the alarms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.68,0:57:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好吗 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.16,0:58:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我再进货…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. After l, uh, restock this stuff…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.50,0:58:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些小客户就不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that these pinhead customers can't manage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.53,0:58:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己来还架子了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to return to the shelves themselves…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.47,0:58:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别再干了好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can blow out of here, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.90,0:58:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Righty-o, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.05,0:58:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳 是温迪和凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erin, it's Wendy and Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.81,0:58:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.45,0:58:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们他妈的把我吓死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the shit out of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.38,0:58:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,先听我们把话说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, wait till you hear what we have to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.16,0:58:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫泽普 我是皮普 到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip, it's Pip. Come over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.13,0:58:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听了会说不出话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna trip when you hear this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.90,0:58:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吊我胃口 皮普 我就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, paint me intrigued, Pip. I'm on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.14,0:58:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,说简单点吧 我会被钉子钉死…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me get this straight. I'm gonna O.D. on nail polish…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.61,0:58:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,依安也会死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lan is gonna be embarrassed to death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.61,0:58:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到那天温迪是怎么了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what happened to Wendy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.28,0:59:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有发生在其他人身上的事 你们看到照片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened to the others? I mean, you just saw their pictures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.76,0:59:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 伙计们 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, guys, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.23,0:59:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了？太吓人了 太吓人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? That's crazy! That's crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.47,0:59:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想知道云霄飞车上 坐在你们后面的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know who was sitting behind you on the roller coaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.20,0:59:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在云霄飞车上坐在我们后面的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, who was sitting behind us on the roller coaster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.61,0:59:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是那个被选出来当…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, wait! Wasn't it that one guy who got voted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.61,0:59:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,红龙虾西餐店经理的那个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}most likely to become manager at Red Lobster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.48,0:59:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 哦 我想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. You know what? God, I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.71,0:59:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人 穿着黑色斗篷…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this guy, uh, black cloak…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.52,0:59:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没看到他的脸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see his face, but, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.08,0:59:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,服务员没收了他的镰刀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ride attendant did take his sickle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.32,0:59:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在开车之前 不知道这个对你们有没有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the ride started if that's helpful in any way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.72,0:59:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我们会在乎你的嘲笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we care if you laugh at us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.62,0:59:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这关系到我们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our lives, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.16,0:59:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有选择 你就直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What choice do we have? Just give into it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.46,0:59:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 知道吗 根本没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. You know what? There is no "it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.30,0:59:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的意思是说死神好像一个人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, wait, are you guys saying that Death is, like, a person?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.23,0:59:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是一种力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's like…like a force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.90,1:00:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 力量只是力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, you know what? A force is just a force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.64,1:00:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的 只是能量转换而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing else. Just transferred energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.14,1:00:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 力量没有目标性 没有自主意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it has no goals, no awareness that is a force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.65,1:00:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这件事有自主意识 麦金利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is awareness, McKinley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.35,1:00:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据过去的经验 如果这条线的下一个人获救…\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln fact, in past cases, if the next in line is saved…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.82,1:00:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人就逃脱了死神的索命 这就是我们来这的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd skip that person. That's why we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.12,1:00:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 老兄 你吸了什么迷药了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, what have you been smoking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.46,1:00:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最上层 - 好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Top shelf. - OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.94,1:00:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 那些条幅 照片里有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin! Those banners. They're in the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.31,1:00:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,依安 小心那些箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}lan, watch those boxes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.98,1:00:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 老兄 你说箱子会掉下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck, man? You said those boxes were falling!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.85,1:00:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我说小心那些箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I said watch the boxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.65,1:00:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？干什么？他们什么也干不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? What for? They're not doing anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.32,1:00:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是想救你们 没什么好抱歉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna apologize for trying to save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.29,1:00:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还没有看到或经历我们经历的 暂时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't seen or been through what we have…yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.20,1:00:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 暂时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.83,1:01:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上你们觉得谁是下一个 我还是依安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, so who's next in this theory you have, me or lan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.10,1:01:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道是按照 我们坐云霄飞车的前后顺序…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we know the order of how we were sitting on the roller coaster…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.50,1:01:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还不知道坐在一起的人 谁先谁后\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not how it works with people who sat together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.97,1:01:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道阿什丽姐妹是哪个先死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, we don't know if Ashley or Ashlyn died first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.81,1:01:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 死神还真会玩复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. God, Death is fucking complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.95,1:01:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 知道吗 一点也不复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you know what? It's not complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.08,1:01:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 是人都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's simple. People die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.68,1:01:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是生命的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just part of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.12,1:01:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 每天有15万人死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}150, 000 people a day, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.92,1:01:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know? I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.86,1:01:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是生物学上的实体 而死亡只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're biological entities, and death is just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.92,1:01:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最上层 - 生物功能的终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Top shelf. - the end of biological function.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.26,1:01:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as simple as that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.17,1:01:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么解释我们遇到的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you explain what happened to us as simple?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.67,1:01:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 如果温迪没有预测到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if Wendy never had that premonition…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.51,1:01:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人下那节车 我们现在都是死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and none of us had gotten off that ride, we'd all be dead right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.04,1:01:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对你来说无所谓吗？- 哦 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does that not make sense to you? - Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.41,1:01:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 那些纯粹死于心脏病的人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, how come when a guy dies of a plain heart attack…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.35,1:01:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one goes, like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.02,1:01:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 他当时正在吃法国烤面包…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, wow, he was eating French toast…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.19,1:01:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而戴安娜王妃正巧在巴黎出车祸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"when Princess Diana died in Paris…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.02,1:01:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他边看电视转播的葬礼时 就突然死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and then he saw her funeral on TV, and now he's dead"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.22,1:02:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道为什么 这听上去就像疯子在说话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why? Because they'd sound crazy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.79,1:02:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以知道你们两个像什么吗？疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}so guess how you two sound right now? Crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.30,1:02:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,泽普 我干完了 现在你去割夹板吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip, I'm done. So finish cutting those orders…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.73,1:02:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 钉完我们就走 - 好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so we can get out of here. - OK!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.07,1:03:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.94,1:03:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.81,1:03:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算按照你们的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go with what you guys are saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.81,1:03:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,比方这样说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.14,1:03:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神有他的计划…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Death does have a conscious plan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.61,1:04:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这计划开始启动了 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that it's been set into motion. Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.98,1:04:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么按照牛顿的第三运动定律…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Newton's third law of motion, and, well, look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.18,1:04:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这定律应该对死神也管用…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just guessing that it goes for Death, too…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.05,1:04:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他是在我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he's working in our world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.92,1:04:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛顿说每一个动力 都会有一个反作用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton says that every action has an equal and opposite reaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.89,1:04:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that means that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.99,1:04:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神如果采取行动 我们也能\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Death has taken action, so can we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.93,1:04:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所采取的行动…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that that action we take might have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.17,1:04:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,会成为阻止死神计划的反作用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}an opposite reaction that thwarts Death's intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.77,1:04:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个混蛋 但说下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being a fucker, but go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.54,1:04:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.44,1:04:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if, for example…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.71,1:04:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在死神列表的最后一个人 做了一个很功利主义的选择…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the last in line were to make the utilitarian choice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.85,1:04:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如自杀 那会怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.19,1:04:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 那绝对会坏了死神的计划…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! Wow! That's pretty much gonna ruin any plan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.66,1:04:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,更妙的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Death's put in motion. And even better…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.39,1:04:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,被跳过的5个人就得救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, it's gonna save five skipped lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.37,1:04:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人反对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any takers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.57,1:05:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I didn't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.55,1:05:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There! Those!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.91,1:06:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没说 我觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything. I mean, I think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.08,1:06:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想吓唬我们让我们说出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were trying to scare us into saying something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.58,1:06:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们没理由监禁我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they had nothing to keep me there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.62,1:06:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他们什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you tell 'em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.09,1:06:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部 我什么也没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything. I didn't do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.35,1:06:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他们我拍的照片…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them about the pictures in the camera…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.19,1:06:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,180航班 弗兰基和路易斯的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Flight 180 and Frankie and Lewis…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.39,1:06:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我们为什么去找依安和埃琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}and why we went to see lan and Erin and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.79,1:06:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们信你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they believe you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.26,1:06:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你信我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. Would you believe me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.33,1:06:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们看着我好像我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they looked at me like I was crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.87,1:06:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拖了我们10个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 hours they had us in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.34,1:06:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all we know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.74,1:06:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管谁坐在埃琳后面 他们已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever was sitting behind Erin is already dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.64,1:06:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下去就是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.24,1:06:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.61,1:06:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,依安差点先死 但是因为我们的干预\N{\fnArial\fs30}lan almost died first, but we intervened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.75,1:06:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神跳过了依安 我们又夺回了控制权\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it skipped lan. That's… that's how we regain control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.15,1:06:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人从中干预…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If someone intercedes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.49,1:06:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个人就会别跳过\N{\fnArial\fs30}the life that was supposed to be next is skipped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.39,1:06:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.66,1:07:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 根据座位顺序…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, going by the way we sat on the roller coaster…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.63,1:07:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个轮到我 然后是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm next… and then you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.83,1:07:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能打破这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can beat this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.03,1:07:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经很接近了 不能放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're so close. We can't give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.04,1:07:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸来了 他来接我回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, my dad's here. He's gonna give me a ride back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.31,1:07:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我们不用呆在一起吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But are you sure we shouldn't stick together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.31,1:07:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就分开几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just for a couple of hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.21,1:07:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？就几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? A couple of hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.25,1:07:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回去后 好好看看照片 看能不能找到更多线索…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back, look at the pictures, see if you can find any more clues…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.22,1:07:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去问所有我认识的人 看他们是否知道还有谁没有坐那节车\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll ask everybody I see if they know if anyone else got off the ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.99,1:07:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.39,1:07:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么要让我知道的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there something I should know about going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.53,1:07:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.73,1:07:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每分每秒都会为你提心吊胆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just be freaking out every second…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.27,1:07:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}hoping you're OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.24,1:07:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.51,1:07:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们彼此都不欣赏对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we don't even like each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.47,1:07:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.18,1:07:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.72,1:08:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.95,1:08:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我带着手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I got my cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.75,1:08:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.17,1:08:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Wen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.47,1:08:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我约了人一起参加纪念日庆典…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're meeting some guys at that centennial thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.28,1:08:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的需要我的…幸运手链\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I could really use my good-luck…bracelet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.34,1:09:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我是茱丽 请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this is Julie. Leave a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.24,1:09:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上给我回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me on my cell right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.69,1:09:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.99,1:09:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗 茱丽也上云霄飞车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember Julie being on the roller coaster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.92,1:09:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你妹妹？不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, your sister? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.79,1:09:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她上了 她会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she would've said something by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.16,1:09:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在依安和埃琳后面的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person sitting behind lan and Erin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.76,1:09:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着相同款式的魔法手链…\N{\fnArial\fs30}was wearing the exact same charm bracelet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.43,1:09:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖母留给她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}our grandmother gave her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.20,1:09:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,安泊和帕丽很可能和她在一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber or Perry were probably with her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.23,1:09:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以接下去就是她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they're next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.00,1:09:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须找到茱丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find Julie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.40,1:09:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她出去参加纪念日庆典了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went to the tricentennial thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.54,1:10:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这 做保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, l…I'm here now, working security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.57,1:10:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll start looking for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.24,1:10:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就来 - 温 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm on my way. - Wen, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.21,1:10:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 她们后面就轮到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, after them, we're next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.94,1:10:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一我们也跟着出事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So in case somethin' happens to 'em…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.25,1:10:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在见面之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we meet up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.95,1:10:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我们上次说好的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}remember that time we talked about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.72,1:10:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,何时看我们的照片？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When to look at our pictures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.45,1:10:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.76,1:10:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 我的上面没有线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Mine has no clue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.53,1:10:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我站在黑色背景前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me standing in front of a blank background…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.33,1:10:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和杰森一起 在游乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Jason at the amusement park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.74,1:10:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 麦金利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. McKinley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.74,1:10:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,依安？他也在照片里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}lan? ls he in the picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.88,1:10:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有 但这似乎是个线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but it…it feels like a clue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.75,1:10:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的照片 我拍的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yours is the picture that I took…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.12,1:10:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着你的脸打了闪光灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I flashed the camera in your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.88,1:10:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,焦距不对 感光过度 好像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all out of focus and overexposed, like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.43,1:10:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像焰火溅到我脸上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a firework went off in my face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.65,1:11:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.89,1:11:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,走在你的身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking behind you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.26,1:11:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.53,1:11:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.40,1:11:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,注视着你的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching your footsteps{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.04,1:11:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.55,1:11:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.95,1:11:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样深爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who really loves you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.22,1:11:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国人来了！英国人来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British are coming! The British are coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.39,1:11:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 - 棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoo! - Yay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.96,1:12:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘胜追击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em while they're hot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.26,1:12:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个给红衣军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it to those Redcoats!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.47,1:12:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,起步 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Column, advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.81,1:12:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,风筝飞上了高天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kite is aloft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.18,1:12:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们期待着燃放焰火吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let us hope for some lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.02,1:12:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 本·弗兰克林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Ben Franklin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.83,1:12:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要强调 滚开这 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he kept insisting."Get over here " right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.24,1:12:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is awesome dude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.37,1:12:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.67,1:12:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.07,1:12:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.54,1:12:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 出去 把那掐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get out of here with those, man! You're gonna set these off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.58,1:12:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.08,1:12:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, let's go! Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.98,1:13:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 为庆祝麦金利镇建镇300年…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, to celebrate McKinley's tricentennial…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.75,1:13:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,焰火表演马上就要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fireworks extravaganza will begin shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.63,1:13:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊 茱丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Julie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.19,1:13:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.20,1:13:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是卡利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Kahlil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.13,1:13:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要不要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.77,1:13:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 抱歉 你们不能呆在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. I'm sorry, but you can't be here, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.47,1:13:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看台在那边 你也是先生 请离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}The viewing site is over there. You too, sir. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.80,1:13:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不想让我们离开 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna make us move are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.67,1:13:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fucking believe them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.31,1:13:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 清场了 - 嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, we gotta clear out. - Mm-hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.38,1:13:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.01,1:14:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小姐们 - 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ladies. - Boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.58,1:14:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,近来怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.78,1:14:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 茱丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Julie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.65,1:14:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们三个得跟我来 - 我们做什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You three need to come with me. - What did we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.12,1:14:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 是为了你们的安全 茱丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's for your own safety, Julie, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.85,1:14:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一离开这儿我就告诉你原因 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you about it as soon as we get away from here, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.72,1:14:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.59,1:14:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.69,1:14:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey whoa whoa whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.92,1:14:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.46,1:14:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小可爱 - 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweet. - Ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.16,1:14:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.50,1:14:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,点起来 点起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light it! Light it! Go, go, go, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.51,1:15:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱丽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.08,1:15:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh! Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.98,1:15:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死的 - 我们成保证人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh shit! - Dude we gotta bail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.17,1:15:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱丽 不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie! No, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.41,1:15:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很危险 听我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in danger, OK? I'm trying to explain something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.91,1:15:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听我解释吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me explain this to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.55,1:15:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱丽 小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie, look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.35,1:15:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊哈！- 噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Unh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.69,1:15:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.53,1:15:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱丽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.63,1:15:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.20,1:16:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Unh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.93,1:16:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut him off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.37,1:16:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.24,1:16:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.51,1:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.98,1:16:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.89,1:16:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.60,1:16:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 它很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back! He's dangerous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.40,1:16:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我牵住它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.57,1:16:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我走 - 不 茱丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just let me go. - No, Julie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.80,1:16:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须告诉我 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell me, you have to listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.04,1:16:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我那天在云霄飞车上 谁坐在你旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me who was sitting next to you on the roller coaster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.34,1:16:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 茱丽 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Julie, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.91,1:16:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 快告诉我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me! You have to tell me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.25,1:16:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在云霄飞车上坐在你旁边的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was sitting next to you on the roller coaster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.15,1:16:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？下一个就轮到她了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? She's next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.12,1:16:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.17,1:17:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.58,1:17:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.11,1:17:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.82,1:17:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.05,1:17:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.29,1:17:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你了 麦金利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for that, McKinley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.73,1:17:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 麦金利 - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, McKinley! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.73,1:17:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get out of here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.23,1:17:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.43,1:17:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,依安·麦金利 让我丧命的就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}lan McKinley. He causes my death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.07,1:17:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在照片里 我穿了件麦金利校服\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln my picture I was wearing the McKinley grad night shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.24,1:17:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他就是那个线索 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's the clue. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.04,1:17:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有个救援帐篷 那里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a first aid tent, there should be security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.21,1:17:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开 麦金利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck outta here, McKinley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.21,1:18:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我是来庆贺建镇300周年纪念的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm just celebrating our town's tricentennial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.39,1:18:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟着我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You followed me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.49,1:18:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有妄想症吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! You are paranoid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.42,1:18:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 刚才的事我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, I saw what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.53,1:18:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是下一个对不对？你是最后一个人 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're next, right? You're the end of it, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.33,1:18:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我好像也有妄想症了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I would be paranoid, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.76,1:18:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没相信过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't even believe me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.60,1:18:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 眼见为实嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, seeing is believing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.70,1:18:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就必须离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you have to stay away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.44,1:18:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,「必须」 太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Have to"? Wow, that's extreme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.38,1:18:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.18,1:18:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我让你死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I cause your death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.55,1:18:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你导致了埃琳的死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you caused Erin's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.52,1:18:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, what? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.56,1:18:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到幻觉了吗 里面有我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a vision? Was I in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.46,1:18:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片里有我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was I in a picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.63,1:18:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me how to start it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.10,1:18:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this over with!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.80,1:18:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别靠近我 我就得救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll save me if you just stay away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.57,1:18:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一切就都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it'll all be over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.91,1:18:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我管你干什么？反正我已经被跳过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I care? lt skipped me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.91,1:19:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我来说 已经结束了 我不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, it is over. I'm not dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.74,1:19:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not dying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.12,1:19:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.86,1:19:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.96,1:19:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.26,1:19:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的是你 温迪 你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you, Wendy! You're dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.20,1:19:56.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（5个月后）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.54,1:20:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.47,1:20:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.34,1:20:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那个超好的咖喱店怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what about that great curry place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.61,1:20:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是应该在布斯下车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't we get off at Booth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.05,1:20:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说格帕斯 应该在奥斯沃下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean Gupta's. You get off at Oswald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.95,1:20:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.75,1:20:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果感恩节不能回家的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if I can't be home for Thanksgiving…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.25,1:20:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须自己弄点传统食物吃 让自己感觉回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some semblance of a traditional dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.05,1:20:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,火鸡 酱 派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turkey, stuffing, pie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.52,1:20:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一次感恩节不吃火鸡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't have turkey for one Thanksgiving…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.86,1:20:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,会难受死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that really gonna kill you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.49,1:20:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.66,1:20:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走在你身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking behind you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.17,1:20:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.50,1:20:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.24,1:20:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.64,1:20:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,注视着你的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching your footsteps{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.55,1:20:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.36,1:21:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.66,1:21:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who really needs you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.83,1:21:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你我的真心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.90,1:21:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.27,1:21:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车即将到达布斯街\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Booth Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.67,1:21:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一站 终点站 奥斯沃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next stop is Oswald. End of the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.14,1:21:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一站是终点站\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next stop is the end of the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.25,1:21:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪！这站停了还有一站才下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy! Next stop after this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.05,1:21:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走过去吧 - 外面冻死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's just walk. - It's freezing out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.35,1:21:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但空气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but the air'll feel good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.02,1:22:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要点空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use some air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.33,1:22:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.93,1:22:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 是啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha! Yeah, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.20,1:22:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, man. See ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.56,1:22:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 黑熊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Bruins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.63,1:22:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑熊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruins, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.51,1:22:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey man peace out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.08,1:22:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下吧 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.65,1:22:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着点 - 嘿 黑熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out! - Hey, Bruins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.09,1:22:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错过开头了 你看了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed the beginning. Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.12,1:22:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.29,1:22:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 借过一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, comin' through. Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.96,1:22:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.90,1:22:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.40,1:22:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我们走 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.41,1:22:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们今晚前到不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you weren't coming tilI tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.11,1:22:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸的车到哪儿都能抛锚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dad's car just, like, dies out of nowhere…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.58,1:23:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,过节了连个修车的地方都找不到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he couldn't get it fixed anywhere on a holiday…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.41,1:23:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,与其坐着等几个小时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so instead of sitting around for a few hours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.82,1:23:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如搭头班车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lucked out and caught an early train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.78,1:23:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我没有打乱你的计划吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I'm not messing you up or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.59,1:23:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's just, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.79,1:23:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我感觉到你马上就会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I had a sense that you were coming now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.43,1:23:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.90,1:23:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那天晚上的感觉又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was feeling like I did that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.24,1:23:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.27,1:23:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我 凯文 都逃过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, me, Kevin went over a thousand scenarios.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.17,1:23:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,依安本来会杀了你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}lan was gonna cause your death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.51,1:23:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你阻止了他 所以我们都被跳过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you intervened, and it skipped us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.98,1:23:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我一点也不担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.75,1:23:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我碰到过凯文 他也一点不担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran into Kevin at home. He's not worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.72,1:23:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, if I were you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.02,1:23:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我和凯文出事之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}until something happens to me and then Kevin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.43,1:23:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没什么好担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've got nothing to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.40,1:23:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.27,1:23:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.13,1:23:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 来见见我的室友和朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I…I want you to meet my roommate and my friend, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.34,1:23:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.37,1:24:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是茱丽 我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. This is Julie, my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.42,1:24:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.79,1:24:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪！茱丽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy! Julie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.02,1:24:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太巧了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the chances?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.96,1:24:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上这班车多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been on this train?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.36,1:24:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我家那边上车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, since home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.99,1:24:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在研究这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was headin' up to check out the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.86,1:24:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来应该看到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna look you up afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.03,1:24:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.30,1:24:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么问题了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.68,1:24:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.01,1:25:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 茱丽 蹲下 - 啊哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Julie, stay down! - Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.04,1:25:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱丽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.31,1:25:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.45,1:25:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文！- 呃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin! - Unh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.52,1:25:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaaaaah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.62,1:25:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.49,1:25:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.74,1:26:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈！噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Unh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.36,1:26:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.00,1:26:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来应该看到你的 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna look you up afterwards, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.71,1:26:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.81,1:26:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么问题了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls somethin' wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.38,1:26:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆车…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The train…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.61,1:26:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Not again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.68,1:26:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须下车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.32,1:27:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管用了 有人吗 停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working. Somebody stop the train!{\r}
